<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101894" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχίσ-ις</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ,
			</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχίζω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cleavage, parting</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				97a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				101c
			</span></i>; of roads, ib.<i><span class="en">
				108a
			</span></i>; of the wings of birds (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχιζόπτερος</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				532a26
			</span></i>; of the feet of animals (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχιζόπους</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>PA</u>
				663a31
			</span></i>; of a plant, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.187
			</span></i>; of rivers, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.93f
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ τὴν σχίσιν</span> at the
				<i>cleavage</i> (of the gullet into oesophagus and trachea),
			cj. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ σχέσιν</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάσχεσιν</span>
			) in <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				8.1.18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδένες . . σχίσεις ἀγγείων στηρίζοντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					6.674
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				15.532
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>curdling</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ γάλακτος</span>
			(v. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχίζω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.3
				</span></i>
			) <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				6.694
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philum.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				45.29.10
			</span></i>.</div>
